# The HSM 400U's Siemens servos are wound for a 600 V DC link; on an stmbl
# drive's ~325 V bus (230 V mains rectified) the voltage runs out at about
# 1750 rpm: an X rapid (16 mm screw) at 28 m/min follows within 50 um, at
# 34 m/min the drive can't and trips (position error). machine/hsm400u_380v.mill:
# a 380 V bus does 34 m/min.
@program mill/mill_sim
@args mill/machine/hsm400u.mill
@timeout 300
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 2.5 10 225 -100 0 0
run 0.4
trapfrac 0.1
mark
tmove 0.905 390 225 -100 0 0
run 0.2
print fault max_ferr_x
move 2.5 10 225 -100 0 0
run 0.4
mark
tmove 0.745 390 225 -100 0 0
run 0.2
print fault fault_code
@expect mill.fault[1] == 0
@expect mill.max_ferr_x < 50
@expect mill.fault[2] == 1
@expect mill.fault_code == 5
